    "title": "No students hurt in Wilkes County school bus crash - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Staff ,\n11 hours ago WASHINGTON, Ga. (WRDW/WAGT) - A school bus was involved in a traffic accident Wednesday on North Butler Street. “We are thankful to report that there have been no reported injuries to any students, the bus driver, or others involved at this time,” the Wilkes County Sheriff’s Office said in a Facebook post. Read full article\n1",
